  "details": "If VRC really want's to fix the game and appease the larger playerbase, a good idea would be to roll out an experimental mode where clients can be used at your own risk with support removed, and a vanilla version where the base game is how they want it.\nThis way people could opt in to what kind of gameplay they want to take part in, better option than pissing off half of the player base.\nWith an option like this, the player will have access to servers with either clients allowed, or not depending on the gameplay the player prefers.",
